&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFk933IZbIxLv9w6jQj-tmFwGGOLV7LX2Ojk8-FJnhgfw&oe=6A8EDC3F"}, {"file_name": "Untitled design (93).png", "id": "784458414729379", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310734_784458418062712_1967178000690598242_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=shmAraEX1d4Q7kNvwHIPSHM&_nc_oc=AdrWwI6dof_XOKo87fvNmN4G-oNDsJKs2HeQ3PAKM1i1DwGE8M_zzaAo43bIepW0jlE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGKmIJkkHA-gH3s9EHtRLWEF21DWNwZK5m7mH4acKKRAg&oe=6A8EE6FE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "SEALTOPIA", "keywords": [], "long_description": "From the creators of **Seal Game's** comes a brand-new adventure and the spiritual successor you've been waiting for...\n\nSEALTOPIA VR\n\nWelcome to SEALTOPIA, a fast-paced multiplayer VR party game where the goal is simple: have as much fun as possible. Jump into a world filled with energetic seals, exciting activities, and unforgettable moments with friends.\n\nRun, jump, tag, dodge, and explore a variety of unique experiences, or take a break and relax with others in Social Mode. Whether you're competing in chaotic games or simply hanging out, there's always something to do.\n\nWith fun gameplay, lively environments, and endless opportunities to make memories, SEALTOPIA VR is the perfect place to play, laugh, and keep the adventure going.\n\nThe party starts now. Play SEALTOPIA VR today!*", "short_description": "From the creators of Seal Game's comes its spiritual successor...\n\n\ud83e\uddadSEALTOPIA\ud83e\uddad\n\nWelcome to **SEALTOPIA**, a multiplayer VR party game where fun comes first! Run, jump, tag, dodge, and explore a world full of exciting activities and memorable moments with friends.\n\nWhether you're competing in chaotic game modes or relaxing in Social Mode, there's always something new to experience.\n\nJump in, make new friends, and start the party in SEALTOPIA VR today!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/17Nw68umk2Kf6vxilkdH59G2-hQUc2zYHDGdWTbmdsI8/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BurntWaffleGames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/burntwafflegames/home?authuser=5", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "1239992505864431"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1708203583801759"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1708203583801759"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1786132800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1708203583801759"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1282813244915690", "version": "0.0.29 - New tag map + better customization"}, "id": "2264230814117535", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1230534490143566", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1282813244915690"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2264230814117535"}]}, "change_log": "# SEALTOPIA UPDATE!\nv 0.0.28 - New tag map + better customization\n\n**Whats New?**\n\n# New Tag Map!\nWe got tired of using the same basic demo map for tag... so we changed it!\nThe new tag map is set in a snowy forest with LOST more room to move, dash, and swing away form tagged seals!\n\n# Better Customization!\nYOU HEARD IT RIGHT!\nYour now able to customize your seal **EVEN MORE** with the 3 new cosmetic slots!\n**Skins, Gloves, and Badges!!** (and more coming soon :eyes: )\n\nOthers/Unimportant:\n- You can no longer \"cheat\" parkour\n- Removed PUNK bundle\n- Server Fixes\n- a few things i forgot\n\n**Coming Soon/Working on**\n||- SandBox\n- Horror\n- Zombies\n- Cosmic Bundle||", "created_date": 1787361065, "id": "1282813244915690", "version": "0.0.29 - New tag map + better customization", "version_code": 29, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1230534490143566", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1282813244915690"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1787353898, "id": "1282698901593791", "version": "0.0.28 - New tag map + better customization", "version_code": 28, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1230534490143566", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1282813244915690"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2264230814117535"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1786910073, "id": "1271195559410792", "version": "0.0.27 - Small Update", "version_code": 27, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1230534490143566", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1282813244915690"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2264230814117535"}]}, "change_log": "**Small SEALTOPIA Update!**\n\n(v0.0.25 - Small Update)\n\n**Whats New??**\n\n# Parkour Changes\nParkour now has 3 different difficulty's\nEasy, medium, and hard!\n\nRight now there isnt any reward for beating it, BUT we are actively working on that!!\n\nAlso there is a warning when the lava is visable, AND when its over and starting to fall\n\nAlso it falls REALLY fast now so players wont have to wait long before jumping back in!\n\n# Shop Changes!\nWere testing a new demo of the shop where its now now manually updated by the dev's and not just random! this should allow us to make sure players are getting what they want!\n\n# Other Changes\n- Made it easy to get to \"The Rooms\"\n- Fixed Server related bugs (i hope)\n- a few other things i lowk forgot lol\n\n# DONT FORGET TO LEAVE A REVIEW!!! \n\nEnjoy :)", "created_date": 1786901589, "id": "1271023936094621", "version": "0.0.26 - Small Update", "version_code": 26, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1230534490143566", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1282813244915690"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2264230814117535"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1786829997, "id": "1269735029556845", "version": "0.0.25 - Bug Fix Again :(", "version_code": 25, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}